OL,3,AThree children injured after school bus
OL,4,Aroof ripped off in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree children have been injured when a
OL,7,Fschool bus crashed into a railway
OL,8,Fbridge, police have said.
OL,10,FGwent Police said it received a report
OL,11,Fof a collision in Tregare Street,
OL,12,FNewport, at about 07:45 BST on Tuesday.
OL,14,FThe pupils' injuries are not thought to
OL,15,Fbe life-threatening, the force said,
OL,16,Fbut the children have been taken to
OL,17,Fhospital for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
