OL,3,AThree children injured after school bus
OL,4,Aroof ripped off in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews from South Wales Fire and Rescue
OL,7,FService and the Welsh Ambulance Service
OL,8,Fattended the scene, and the road
OL,9,Fremains closed with diversions in
OL,10,Fplace.
